 "comments": [
  {
   "id": "c1",
   "text": "Free for all, no buying, and you come back 2 seconds after you die, with the gun of your level and 2 seconds of God Mode so nobody is shot as they appear.",
   "pos": {
    "x": 41,
    "y": 4
   },
   "size": {
    "w": 2278,
    "h": 670
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "c2",
   "text": "A kill by another player moves the killer up a level and hands over the next gun at once. Level 14 is the knife, and a kill with it wins. A suicide costs a level.",
   "pos": {
    "x": 41,
    "y": 3178
   },
   "size": {
    "w": 3278,
    "h": 1077
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "c3",
   "text": "Someone made it through every gun: everyone hears who, levels go back to 0 and a new round starts.",
   "pos": {
    "x": 2648,
    "y": 4321
   },
   "size": {
    "w": 2671,
    "h": 376
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "c4",
   "text": "Give Level Gun: takes everything but the knife and gives the gun for the player's level (glock18, usp, deagle, mac10, mp5navy, ump45, p90, m3, xm1014, galil, famas, ak47, m4a1, awp, then the knife).",
   "pos": {
